# 🏠 Parker - Real Estate Lead Generation Bot

A free, open-source lead aggregation bot for Islamabad real estate market. Automatically scrapes and organizes leads from all major platforms.

**Features:**
- ✅ Multi-platform scraping (Facebook, Twitter, Reddit, Google)
- ✅ Real-time lead collection & notifications
- ✅ Web dashboard for lead management
- ✅ Lead scoring & filtering
- ✅ Free hosting & deployment
- ✅ Completely open-source

