## ⚙️ Configuration

### Get Free API Keys

#### Twitter/X (Recommended - Easiest)
1. Go to [developer.twitter.com](https://developer.twitter.com)
2. Create a project and app
3. Get Bearer Token from "Keys and tokens" tab
4. Add to `.env` as `TWITTER_BEARER_TOKEN`

#### Facebook Graph API
1. Go to [developers.facebook.com](https://developers.facebook.com)
2. Create an app (type: Consumer)
3. Add Facebook Login product
4. Get access token from Tools → Access Token Debugger
5. Add to `.env` as `FACEBOOK_ACCESS_TOKEN`

#### MongoDB Atlas (Free Database)
1. Create account at [mongodb.com/cloud/atlas](https://www.mongodb.com/cloud/atlas)
2. Create a free cluster
3. Get connection string
4. Add to `.env` as `MONGODB_URI`

#### Keywords Configuration

Edit `config/keywords.js`:

```javascript
module.exports = {
  locations: ['Islamabad', 'Rawalpindi', 'F-7', 'F-8', 'F-9', 'F-10', 'G-6', 'G-7'],
  propertyTypes: ['apartment', 'house', 'flat', 'studio', 'room'],
  keywords: [
    'rent', 'short term rental', 'furnished', 'unfurnished',
    'booking', 'available', 'urgent', 'per night'
  ],
  exclude: ['scam', 'fraud', 'spam']
};
```

