## 💻 Usage

### Dashboard Features

**1. View All Leads**
- Filter by date, platform, location, property type
- Search by keywords
- Sort by relevance/recency

**2. Lead Details**
- Full post content
- User profile link
- Engagement metrics (likes, comments)
- Direct link to original post
- Contact information (if available)

**3. Lead Scoring**
- Automatic scoring based on:
  - Keyword relevance
  - Engagement level
  - Account age & credibility
  - Message urgency

**4. Manage Leads**
- Mark as contacted
- Add notes
- Set follow-up reminders
- Export to CSV

### API Endpoints

```bash
# Get all leads
GET /api/leads?page=1&limit=20

# Get leads by platform
GET /api/leads?platform=twitter

# Get leads by date
GET /api/leads?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-07

# Get single lead
GET /api/leads/:id

# Create lead (manual)
POST /api/leads
{
  "title": "...",
  "content": "...",
  "platform": "facebook",
  "link": "...",
  "score": 85
}

# Update lead status
PATCH /api/leads/:id
{ "status": "contacted" }

# Get statistics
GET /api/stats
```

